      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Flor Solitária. Flabébé extrai o poder oculto das flores silvestres e gosta especialmente das vermelhas. Este indivíduo cavalga uma flor vermelha. Logo após nascer, ele começa a voar em busca de uma flor de que goste.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 0% M / 100% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Flabébé pode evoluir para Floette no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle, Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Fairy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Lucky Chant, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Wish</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Grassy Terrain, Magical Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Petal Blizzard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Aromatherapy, Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Misty Terrain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Moonblast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Petal Dance, Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Alluring Voice, Ally Switch, Attract, Baton Pass, Calm Mind, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Terrain, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magical Leaf, Misty Terrain, Nature Power, Petal Blizzard, Pollen Puff, Protect, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Synthesis, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Camouflage, Captivate, Copycat, Endeavor, Tearful Look</p>",
